  "description": "Quarter, a demon fascinated by human food, ends up possessing a poor human by accident?! Stripped of all his powers and trapped in the body of Go Sunmu, the demon finds that the life of a “low-grade” human is even worse than life in hell, and thus resolves to become a “high-grade” human instead. Meanwhile, Sunho Group, the country’s top conglomerate, opens a special recruitment drive for new employees, disregarding education and work experience. The demon joins as a low-level worker in the company’s food division… What will this demon-turned-office worker gain, and what kind of influence will he have on the humans around him?\n\n*“When thinking like a human doesn’t give you the answer, act like a demon. The company will like it even more!”*\n\nA fantasy drama that sharply and wittily digs into the absurdities of the world!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
